Package: presencemux-uvc-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: UVC gadget function of PresenceMux with dwc2 missed-transfer handling
 The usb_f_uvc module of the Raspberry Pi kernel 6.18.50+rpt-rpi-2712, with
 one patch: a missed isochronous transfer on dwc2 (-ENODATA) drops the cut
 frame, like -EXDEV on dwc3. The stock module cancels the whole queue, and
 the host shows a torn frame.
 .
 DKMS builds the module only for that kernel. On another kernel, the stock
 module loads.
